# Allow-list over deb.sury.org's debian/patches/series, at the Salsa commit in DEB_PATCHES
# (eol/<version>/*/Dockerfile). Every patch of that series appears here in its order; the
# commented-out ones are left out:
# - packaging: Debian paths, defaults and packaging;
# - build: build-system changes for other libraries or toolchains than our bases';
# - behaviour: changed defaults or new features;
# - tests: test-only changes that need a left-out patch;
# - telemetry: deb.sury.org's DNS version check, which reports the PHP version to its server.
